      "images": [
        "images/11964336.jpg"
      ],
      "content": "<div class=\"abbs-post-photo-wrap\">\n  <img src=\"images/11964336.jpg\" class=\"abbs-post-photo\" alt=\"西栅市河晨曦与水阁悬挑\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-weight:600; margin-top:12px; color:var(--text-primary);\">西栅市河晨曦与水阁悬挑</p>\n<p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7;\">传统民居底层以木桩石柱伸入河道，上层筑木制水阁，形成人水相亲的边界界面。</p>"
    },
    {
